---
description: When writing migrations, sqlc queries, or repositories, follow the add-persistence skill and regenerate.
globs:
  - "migrations/**"
  - "sql/**"
  - "sqlc.yaml"
  - "internal/**/repository.go"
  - "internal/store/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the `add-persistence` skill. Add the goose migration, mirror it in `sql/schema`, then add `sql/queries`.

Leave `internal/store/db/` untouched. Regenerate with `make generate`, then `git diff --exit-code internal/store/db`.
